*Example of Collect
*TYPES : BEGIN OF TY,
*          EID(10) TYPE C,
*          ESAL    TYPE I,
*        END OF TY.
*
*DATA WA TYPE TY.
*
*DATA IT TYPE HASHED TABLE OF TY WITH UNIQUE KEY EID.
*
*WA-EID = '101'.
*WA-ESAL = '15000'.
*COLLECT WA INTO IT.
*
*WA-EID = '102'.
*WA-ESAL = '5000'.
*COLLECT WA INTO IT.
*
*WA-EID = '104'.
*WA-ESAL = '1000'.
*COLLECT WA INTO IT.
*WRITE 'Before Adding the fields'.
*LOOP AT IT INTO WA.
*  WRITE:/ WA-EID,WA-ESAL.
*ENDLOOP.
*
*
*ULINE.
*
*WA-EID = '103'.
*WA-ESAL = '2000'.
*COLLECT WA INTO IT.
*
*WA-EID = '104'.
*WA-ESAL = '1000'.
*COLLECT WA INTO IT.
*
*WRITE 'After Adding the fields'.
*LOOP AT IT INTO WA.
*  WRITE:/ WA-EID,WA-ESAL.
*ENDLOOP.
*ULINE.
